{"version":1,"content":"<p>在今年舉行的Adobe MAX 2026大會上，除了大量即將落地的產品更新之外，Adobe也按照慣例公開展示了一系列仍處於實驗階段的「Sneaks」項目。這些項目雖然尚未確定是否會正式推出，但往往代表着Adobe未來產品的發展方向。而今年的焦點幾乎全部圍繞人工智能展開，從創意生成到自動化編輯，再到虛擬協作，AI正越來越深地融入創作者的日常工作流程。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585962.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.887059+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:08:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.716216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.716216+00:00","content_hash":"8bc4c8b9f0b2e97a62e654e9eb4604da45e51f7acf20445f5d56d3a74b4858b9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}